    "hourly-to-salary-calculator": { example: "At NPR 500 per hour for 40 paid hours each week, estimated annual gross pay is NPR 1,040,000 and average monthly gross pay is about NPR 86,666.67.", accuracy: "The estimate assumes 52 paid weeks and does not subtract leave, unpaid time, overtime rules, tax or other deductions.", workflow: "Enter the hourly wage and typical paid hours per week. Compare weekly, average monthly and annual gross figures.", mistakes: "Do not assume 4 weeks equals one average month. Check whether the hours entered are paid hours and whether work is available all year." },
    "tip-calculator": { example: "Tip = bill × tip percentage ÷ 100. On a bill of 2,000 in your chosen currency, a 10% tip is 200 and the total is 2,200. Shared equally by four people, that is 550 each.", accuracy: "The calculator applies a percentage to the entered bill and divides the bill plus tip equally among the people entered. It does not identify whether tax or service charge is already included, calculate itemised shares, or decide what tip is customary in a particular country or venue.", workflow: "Check the printed bill first, enter the amount that should be used as the tip base, choose the percentage and enter the number of people sharing equally. Review the tip amount, total and per-person share before paying.", mistakes: "Do not add another tip automatically if a service charge or gratuity is already included. Do not use an equal split when people ordered different amounts. Enter the tip as a percentage, such as 10 for 10%, and use a positive whole number of people." },
