    "bmi-calculator": { example: "A person weighing 70 kg and 1.75 m tall has BMI = 70 ÷ (1.75 × 1.75) = 22.86. Enter weight in kilograms and height in the unit requested by the fields.", accuracy: "BMI is a screening measure based on height and weight. It does not measure body fat directly and does not account for age, pregnancy, muscle mass or individual health conditions.", workflow: "Check the height unit first, enter current weight, calculate, then interpret the number using an appropriate age- and population-specific reference.", mistakes: "Do not enter centimetres into a metres field or interpret BMI as a diagnosis. For children and teenagers, adult BMI cut-offs are not appropriate." },
